      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天狼星”是整个天空中最亮的星星。\n它的质量是太阳的两倍，光度是太阳的二十五倍，\n是组成冬季大三角的其中一角。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f28b21a0a6629808380d8df851f16b6dc93432f6967c9e6a7ef9ece64cd36cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
